nd Mika go on a date.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2VYUr0qbsX8GqnJCSBkyZv0dtc1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2VYUr0qbsX8GqnJCSBkyZv0dtc1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/2/episode/14"},{"id":"1158112","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Awakusu Group executive Mizuki Akabayashi, nicknamed the “Red Devil of Awakusu,” hates drugs and keeps a vigilant eye on the trends in the city of Ikebukuro. The reason why he hates drugs goes back six years to the night of a fateful encounter.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qHGqYVRrEvaNR70UNansNNsnzq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qHGqYVRrEvaNR70UNansNNsnzq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/2/episode/15"},{"id":"1158113","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rumors spread about “Ikebukuro’s most dangerous man,” claiming things like, “He’s injured. He has a girlfriend. He has a child.” After her defeat by Shizuo, Varona has lost her sense of purpose. At Dennis’ suggestion, she…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-07-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y7Z5xojkRDMB1pcTXxYinjDwC01.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y7Z5xojkRDMB1pcTXxYinjDwC01.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/2/episode/16"},{"id":"1158114","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It’s 